        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hazardous waste, from combined oil and gas production, offshore</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hazardous waste, from combined oil and gas production, offshore
Without drilling wastes and waste going to recycling (batteries).;
UUID: f380201b-870e-3f66-a559-5cf563b8dc19
This dataset includes hazardous waste from the combined offshore production of oil and gas. It includes: hazardous blasting sands, chemicals, paint, oil contaminated wastes, u.o. Batteries are assumed to go to recycling and are therefore excluded.
Location: Data from Norwegian offshore oil and gas production.
Technology: Waste treatment technology according to Swiss standard.
Time period: 2010
Production volume: 1812t hazardous waste in 2010.
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f380201b-870e-3f66-a559-5cf563b8dc19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
